        "original_id": "f00b5c0b-4a97-52f0-a24f-3b7d38af0d84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kait Parker, Rob Marciano, Ginger Zee, Champion\n- Organizations: weather.com, The Weather Channel, ABC\n- Products: The Weather Channel app\n- Programs: Good Morning America\n- Roles: atmospheric scientist, meteorologist\n\nFacts:\n- Kait Parker is an atmospheric scientist who currently works for weather.com and The Weather Channel app.\n- Kait Parker occasionally appears on Good Morning America as a fill-in meteorologist for Rob Marciano on weekends.\n- Rob Marciano currently provides weather forecasts for the weekend editions of Good Morning America on ABC.\n- Ginger Zee vacated the weekend Good Morning America forecasting position when she was chosen to succeed Champion on the daily editions of Good Morning America.",
